{
 "encounter_id": "00850",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right, I've got twenty minutes. I've been feeling low for two months and I've lost interest in everything, and my sister says I need to see someone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for coming. Low for two months. Tell me more."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I just feel flat. Nothing's wrong, exactly. Work's fine. I get home and do nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What have you lost interest in?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The gym, mostly. I used to go five times a week. I haven't been since March."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How's your sleep?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Terrible. I wake at three and my brain starts going."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your energy?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gone. I'm exhausted by lunch."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Concentration?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hopeless. I read an email four times."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had any thoughts of harming yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Not at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Panic attacks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No panic. Just flat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you taking anything at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just the pill, Microgynon, once a day. I take it every day. Well, mostly. I miss the odd one when I'm travelling for work."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Codeine. It makes me vomit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "History?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Migraines. PCOS. And eczema as a kid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Wisdom teeth, 2017."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anyone in the family with low mood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had depression."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Solicitor. Sixty-hour weeks, so don't suggest I take time off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drinking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Wine most nights. Two glasses, maybe three."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the gym?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've stopped, as I said."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 118 over 74, pulse 72, weight 61 kilos.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "For now. You look tearful to me, even though you say flat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm not tearful. I'm just tired. Okay, maybe a bit. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your speech is slow, compared to how you started, when you were rattling through."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any problems with your heart, palpitations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What I'm hearing fits a depressive episode, a moderate one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Depression. Great. What happens now? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for your thyroid and a blood count, and a ferritin level, to make sure nothing physical is behind it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. And treatment? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to start sertraline, 50 mg, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Side effects? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Some nausea at first, usually settles in a week or two. The wine isn't helping the mood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I know. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. Fine. I have to go. ~"
  }
